{"input": "harness是什么意思，有什么作用", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户询问 harness 的含义与作用，属于普通概念问题，且无明确领域上下文，先给出通用含义并简要区分 AI Agent harness 与测试 harness，不建立学习目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "first_text_ms": 3803, "elapsed_ms": 5474, "search_state": "not_called", "replies": ["“Harness”在不同领域含义差别挺大，先看最常见的几种：\n\n- **软件/工程语境**：指“承载体/框架层”，把零散组件连接起来并管理它们的运行。例如测试 harness 就是一套自动运行测试、收集结果的脚手架。\n- **AI/大模型语境**：指包裹模型的**外层运行框架**，负责工具调用、上下文管理、安全约束等，模型本身只负责生成内容。\n- **航空航天/穿戴**：指**线束、安全带/背带**，把电线和接口固定、连接起来。\n\n核心作用可以概括为：**连接、约束、承载**——让原本独立的部件能协同工作或安全使用。\n\n如果你指的是 AI 领域，那 harness 就是让模型“能干活”的那层壳：模型输出文字，harness 决定这些文字怎么变成实际动作、怎么把结果再喂回去。\n\n你具体是在哪个场景下看到这个词的？我可以按那个语境再讲细一点。"], "events": [{"stage": "received", "user_summary": "已保存，准备回应", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "understanding", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 1954}, {"stage": "intent_decided", "user_summary": "已理解本轮要求", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "正在梳理当前问题", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 892}, {"stage": "search_not_called", "user_summary": "本轮未调用网页检索", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "正在准备回答", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 2538}, {"stage": "sources", "user_summary": "来源类型已记录", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "learning_evidence", "user_summary": "学习记录已更新", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "completed", "user_summary": "本轮已回应", "duration_ms": null}], "providers": [], "sources": []}
{"input": "给刚才的 Agent harness 举个生活类比就好", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["followup", "example"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "用生活类比理解 Agent harness", "relation": "continuation", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户基于上文明确 AI Agent 语境，要求用生活类比解释 Agent harness，属普通知识追问+举例，直接回答即可，不建立训练目标。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": false, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "first_text_ms": 3489, "elapsed_ms": 4538, "search_state": "not_called", "replies": ["可以想成**餐厅的服务员**。\n\n后厨的厨师只管做菜——手艺好、出菜快，但他不知道谁点了什么、哪桌先上、客人对花生过敏。这些全由服务员处理：接单、传话、端菜、发现上错就退回重做。\n\n放到 Agent 里，模型就是厨师，只负责“生成内容”；harness 是服务员，负责把用户请求转给它、把它的输出变成实际行动、再把结果带回下一轮。没有服务员，菜做得再好也送不到桌上。"], "events": [{"stage": "received", "user_summary": "已保存，准备回应", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "understanding", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 1732}, {"stage": "intent_decided", "user_summary": "已理解本轮要求", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "正在梳理当前问题", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "teaching_preparation", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 815}, {"stage": "search_not_called", "user_summary": "本轮未调用网页检索", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "正在准备回答", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "answer", "user_summary": "本步骤已完成", "duration_ms": 1889}, {"stage": "sources", "user_summary": "来源类型已记录", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "completed", "user_summary": "本轮已回应", "duration_ms": null}], "providers": [], "sources": []}
{"input": "请搜索 Python 官方文档，核验 for 循环如何遍历列表，给出可点击的原始出处。", "status": "completed", "intent": {"clarification_kind": "none", "conversation_repair": false, "repair_target_message_id": "", "continuation_evidence": "", "continuation_topic": "", "programming_boundary": "none", "programming_learning_request": "", "intents": ["question"], "target_task_id": "", "target_description": "", "relation": "new_topic", "workflow": null, "scope": "conversation", "proposed_actions": [], "clarification": "", "rationale": "用户要求搜索 Python 官方文档核验 for 循环遍历列表并给出可点击原始出处；属于明确要求官方出处的概念问题，直接回答并附官方链接即可，不建立学习目标，不涉及编程交付。", "understanding": "unknown", "answer_evidence": "", "topic_closure": null, "learning_goal_ready": false, "direct_teaching": false, "answer_only": true, "is_jd": false, "needs_verification": true, "cross_check_sources": false, "requested_mode": null, "refresh_sources": false, "public_search_query": "Python official documentation for statement iterating over list", "light_reply": "", "session_tags": [], "handoff_source_ids": [], "handoff_step_ids": [], "memory_selections": []}, "first_text_ms": 17586, "elapsed_ms": 19318, "search_state": "verified", "replies": ["Python 官方文档的 **8.3. `for` 语句** 一节直接给出了依据：`for` 语句用于对序列（例如字符串、元组或列表）或其他可迭代对象中的元素进行迭代。\n\n机制上是这样的：`for` 后面的表达式列表只被**求值一次**，它应产生一个可迭代对象；系统会为这个结果**创建一个迭代器**，然后按迭代器返回每一项的次序，每返回一项就执行一次循环体，并把该项按标准赋值规则赋给目标变量。列表就是这样被遍历的——列表本身可迭代，`for` 逐个取出它的元素。\n\n```python\nfor x in [10, 20, 30]:\n    print(x)      # 依次输出 10、20、30\n```\n\n当所有项被耗尽时（序列为空，或迭代器引发 `StopIteration`），循环结束，此时如果写了 `else`，它的子句体会被执行。\n\n原文出处：[8. 复合语句 — Python 3.10.20 文档](https://docs.python.org/zh-cn/3.10/reference/compound_stmts.html)（见其中的 8.3 节）。"], "events": [{"stage": "received", "user_summary": "已保存，准备回应", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "understanding", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_summary": "正在理解本轮意图", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "model_attempt", "user_summary": "正在处理当前步骤", "duration_ms": null}, {"stage": "intent", "user_s